  "name": "Question 10",
  "problem": "Consider the finite region $D$ enclosed in the first quadrant of the $xy$-plane between the curves and lines\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}},\\,y=\\frac{7}{{x}^{2}},\\,y=x+2,\\,y=x+7.\n$$\n\nA transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nmaps a rectangular region $Δ$ with sides parallel to the $u$- and $v$-axes from the $uv$-plane onto $D$ in the $xy$-plane. Given that\n\n$$\n{T}^{-1}:(x,y)\\to ({x}^{2}y\\,,\\,\\bbox[5pt,white,border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{AA}}\\,),\n$$\n\nwhat could be the missing expression?",
